// A sub-program the lead of shapes.mdt might write (spec/attention.md
// "Sub-programs and amendments"): an application of Noted, the shape its
// parent's envelope lists. It runs the pattern's stages, its report to the
// accountant and its one question, which its admission reserves of the run's
// asks: it declares none, so its static total, 1. Only its definitions are
// the lead's patch; the header is the skeleton's.

mandate @ 0.7

module example.attention.shapes.plan_1 @ 0.1

use example.attention.shapes

workflow Rest = Noted(work: Writer.write, reviewer: accountant, topic: "the rest")
  caps   ModelStd
  budget { steps: 4, agents: 1 }
